abstract: "Restaurant management software for POS, orders, tables, kitchen display, QR ordering, billing and reports, in English and Arabic, running on Cloudflare Workers, D1, R2 and Durable Objects. A fork of Nodedr OrderRestro with Saudi VAT and ZATCA Phase 1 QR support."
